        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Daniel Myrick, Marino Girolami, Eduardo Sánchez\n- Roles: film directors, writers\n- Works: The Blair Witch Project, Zombie Holocaust\n- Awards: Independent Spirit John Cassavetes Award\n- Topics: horror films, psychological horror\n\nFacts:\n- Marino Girolami was born on 1 February 1914 and died on 20 February 1994.\n- Marino Girolami was an Italian film director who gained a cult following for horror films such as \"Zombie Holocaust.\"\n- Daniel Myrick was born on September 3, 1963.\n- Daniel Myrick is an American film director most famous for horror films.\n- In 1999, Daniel Myrick co-directed and co-wrote the psychological horror film \"The Blair Witch Project\" with Eduardo Sánchez.\n- Daniel Myrick and Eduardo Sánchez won the Independent Spirit John Cassavetes Award for \"The Blair Witch Project.\"",
